<Layouts.flash_group flash={@flash} />
<%!-- Landing page owns its colors outright (dark space theme) so it reads
      the same regardless of the visitor's daisyUI light/dark preference. --%>
<style>
  body { background: #05070f; }
  body > ul.menu a, body > ul.menu li { color: #cbd5e1; }
</style>

<div class="fixed inset-0 -z-10 overflow-hidden" aria-hidden="true">
  <div
    class="absolute inset-0"
    style="background:
      radial-gradient(1px 1px at 12% 22%, #e2e8f0 50%, transparent 51%),
      radial-gradient(1px 1px at 78% 12%, #cbd5e1 50%, transparent 51%),
      radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 55% 38%, #f1f5f9 50%, transparent 51%),
      radial-gradient(1px 1px at 33% 68%, #cbd5e1 50%, transparent 51%),
      radial-gradient(1px 1px at 88% 55%, #e2e8f0 50%, transparent 51%),
      radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 8% 85%, #f1f5f9 50%, transparent 51%),
      radial-gradient(1px 1px at 65% 82%, #cbd5e1 50%, transparent 51%),
      radial-gradient(1px 1px at 45% 8%, #e2e8f0 50%, transparent 51%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, #05070f 0%, #0a1020 60%, #0b1526 100%);"
  >
  </div>
  <%!-- The planet: a CSS-only globe peeking over the bottom of the viewport. --%>
  <div
    class="absolute left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full"
    style="width: 160vw; height: 160vw; bottom: -148vw;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 38% 30%, rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.35), transparent 42%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 62% 44%, rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.25), transparent 34%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 50% 20%, #2f6fab 0%, #1e4e7e 45%, #12314f 75%, #0a1c30 100%);
      box-shadow: 0 0 120px 30px rgba(56, 130, 200, 0.25);"
  >
  </div>
</div>

<main class="relative z-[1] mx-auto flex min-h-[calc(100vh-3.5rem)] max-w-5xl flex-col items-center gap-16 px-6 pb-24 pt-16 text-center sm:pt-24">
  <div>
    <p class="mb-3 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-amber-400/90">
      A massively multiplayer 4X
    </p>
    <h1 class="text-5xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-100 sm:text-7xl">
      Broken Oaths
    </h1>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
      Settle a living hex globe that keeps turning while you sleep. When you
      lose, you don't die. Your conqueror makes you a
      <span class="font-semibold text-amber-300">vassal</span>.
      Pay tribute, fight their wars, and plot your rebellion. Then climb the
      whole arc of history with everyone else on the planet, from Stone Age
      raiders to intergalactic powers.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2">
    <.link
      href={~p"/play"}
      class="rounded-lg bg-amber-500 px-10 py-4 text-lg font-bold text-slate-950 shadow-lg shadow-amber-500/25 transition hover:bg-amber-400"
    >
      Play free
    </.link>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Runs in your browser. No download.</p>
  </div>

  <%!-- What you play today --%>
  <section class="w-full">
    <h2 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-slate-500">
      What you play today
    </h2>
    <div class="mt-6 grid w-full gap-4 text-left sm:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-700/60 bg-slate-900/60 p-5 backdrop-blur">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-100">A real globe</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
          29,162 hexes wrap seamlessly around a sphere, plus the 12 pentagons
          geometry demands, cursed into impassable mountains. You found cities,
          research a tech tree, and fight for the terrain that matters.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-700/60 bg-slate-900/60 p-5 backdrop-blur">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-100">Time never stops</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
          Every world ticks once a minute, forever. Your cities grow, your
          units march, and your rivals scheme while you are away. One planet
          holds thousands of players at once.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-700/60 bg-slate-900/60 p-5 backdrop-blur">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-100">Lose without dying</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
          Defeat means vassalage, not deletion. Serve your new lord, watch your
          oath strain build, then coordinate with the other vassals and break
          your oaths together in a war of independence.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-700/60 bg-slate-900/60 p-5 backdrop-blur">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-100">Fog you can't cheat</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
          Hidden tiles never leave the server, so no client mod can reveal the
          map. Every player sees a genuinely different planet.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <%!-- Where it's going --%>
  <section class="w-full">
    <h2 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-slate-500">
      Where it's going
    </h2>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
      Broken Oaths grows into the full span of history and then past it. Your
      political toolkit evolves as you advance: raiders take spoils, empires
      hold cities by force, feudal lords bind vassals by oath, and the great
      powers pool their strength into federations and hegemonies. The tech tree
      runs all the way to the space age and beyond, opening into a Master of
      Orion style intergalactic 4X.
    </p>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
      Older civilizations reach for the stars while fresh players spawn on new
      worlds behind them, so the strong colonize the young and lift them toward
      parity. Gods join above the whole board, trading wonders and miracles to
      rulers for worship, until the ambition scales to intergalactic gods.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-6 flex flex-col items-center gap-2">
      <.link
        href={~p"/roadmap"}
        class="rounded-lg border border-amber-400/50 px-8 py-3 text-base font-bold text-amber-300 transition hover:bg-amber-400/10"
      >
        Read the full roadmap
      </.link>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">
        The march from Stone Age tribes to intergalactic gods, tier by tier.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
